{"id": "EUVD-2026-98660", "enisaUuid": "7f329fec-8627-32bd-b623-c2a65e0ddf98", "description": "NLTK through 3.10.3 contains a path traversal vulnerability in WekaClassifier that allows attackers to bypass nltk.pathsec containment by supplying unvalidated model paths. Attackers controlling the model_filename or model argument can make the weka JVM write files via -d or probe files via -l outside allowed data roots.", "datePublished": "2026-10-13T13:27:20", "dateUpdated": "2026-10-13T13:27:20", "baseScore": 8.3, "baseScoreVersion": "4.0", "baseScoreVector": "CVSS:4.0/AV:N/AC:L/AT:P/PR:N/UI:N/VC:L/VI:H/VA:L/SC:N/SI:N/SA:N", "references": ["https://github.com/nltk/nltk/security/advisories/GHSA-j456-xh4h-cpf2", "https://www.vulncheck.com/advisories/nltk-through-3.10.3-path-traversal-via-wekaclassifier-model-path"], "aliases": ["GHSA-9fgx-q9j8-3j83", "CVE-2026-109956"], "assigner": "VulnCheck", "epss": 0.32, "enisaIdProduct": [{"id": "576dac7e-3244-31a3-8799-bf53e33b659c", "product": {"name": "nltk", "vendor": {"name": "nltk"}}, "product_version": "0 \u22643.10.3"}], "enisaIdVendor": [{"id": "e1015b9a-b64b-37a6-b0e0-ab43e0b82fe2", "vendor": {"name": "nltk"}}], "isExploited": false}